{"id":"7aab232bf2bcb2df","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation.md","title":"Preservation under Unions of Chains","display":"thm-chain-sentence-preservation — Preservation under Unions of Chains","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation","aliases":["17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation"],"display":"thm-chain-sentence-preservation — Preservation under Unions of Chains","depends_on":["[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]","[[17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-sentence-truth]]"],"source_section":"3.2","source_result":"Local single-sentence corollary of Theorem 3.2.3","source_pages_print":[149,150,151],"source_pages_djvu":[165,166,167],"source_verification":"theory-level statement and proof compared in supplied OCR; compactness reduces the finite universal-existential axioms to one sentence","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-3.3.1"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-chain-sentence-preservation — Preservation under Unions of Chains"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba56c3cb1dd7ec8d\" href=\"?note=ba56c3cb1dd7ec8d\" title=\"17-df-chain-union-preservation\">17-df-chain-union-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2024ee60951aa39e\" href=\"?note=2024ee60951aa39e\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments\">17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.2"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Local single-sentence corollary of Theorem 3.2.3"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>149</span><span>150</span><span>151</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>165</span><span>166</span><span>167</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"theory-level statement and proof compared in supplied OCR; compactness reduces the finite universal-existential axioms to one sentence"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-3.3.1"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreserved}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreserved}_L\\)</span> (chain-union preservation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ba56c3cb1dd7ec8d\" href=\"?note=ba56c3cb1dd7ec8d\" title=\"17-df-chain-union-preservation\">17-df-chain-union-preservation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForallExistsSent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{ForallExistsSent}_L\\)</span> (universal-existential sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2024ee60951aa39e\" href=\"?note=2024ee60951aa39e\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments\">17-df-quantifier-prefix-fragments</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (sentence truth, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\n\\Biggl(\n\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreserved}_L(\\sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{ForallExistsSent}_L\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\tau\n\\bigr)\n\\Biggr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\n\\Biggl(\n\\operatorname{ChainUnionPreserved}_L(\\sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{ForallExistsSent}_L\\;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\tau\n\\bigr)\n\\Biggr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Preservation is semantic, while membership in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForallExistsSent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{ForallExistsSent}_L\\)</span> is syntactic; the theorem connects them through equivalence in every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-chain-union-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"ba56c3cb1dd7ec8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","he